          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<div class=\"type-kicker\">Opportunity</div>\n<p>SEI delivers investment solutions that connect the financial services industry. Decades ago, financial advice was all about recommending investment products. SEI’s unique approach, called Advice+, is all about helping people connect how they invest to why they invest. SEI has the advice and systems in place, but needed a trusted partner to bring Advice+ and its marketing campaigns to life. They also needed a partner who could help conceptualize, visualize, and create an animated video that told the Advice+ story.</p>\n"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<div class=\"type-kicker\">Solution</div>\n<p>Partners for over ten years bringing new products, marketing campaigns, and ideas to life, O3 and SEI once again turned to collaboration. Recently helping to extend SEI&#8217;s corporate brand to new touchpoints, O3 worked closely with the internal advisor team on content strategy, storyboarding, design, and motion graphics. The result was a beautifully animated video that succinctly tells the Advice+ story while engaging and enticing new customers to contact SEI. Through this effort, we also provided the Advice+ marketing team with social media-ready assets to complement their campaigns.</p>\n"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
